<article class="work">
  <p>Clipac is a small ventilation company distinguished by its ability to offer a complete service, from drawing up the specifications to commissioning the installation.</p>

  <p>From the outset, we decided together with the client to invest in producing the website — not an obvious choice in an industry where the web doesn't play a major role. The bet paid off, though: orders received through the site covered its development cost within the first six months.</p>
