		    <img src="images/Clipac-Identity-Logo.svg">
		    <figcaption>Instead of a classic symbol, Clipac's identity relies on a system of lines set on a right-angled grid. Inspired by the De Stijl movement, these shapes echo ventilation installations, both in the pattern they form and in their fragmented visibility.</figcaption>
	  </figure>
